# A mark's note done in the viewer (sfbase viewer_marks_node.mbt): a box drawn on a picture of the made-up chat, its
# note written and done; the notes' cards come under the picture, their room opening on its way as the picture is
# fitted over it.
timeout 20000
until 整理发布清单
wait 600
tap 整理发布清单
wait 1000
wheel -900
wait 1800
until img:compare.png
tap img:compare.png
wait 1200
tap icon:edit
wait 800
drag 120 360 140 90 300
until =完成
type 这里要对齐
wait 500
tap =完成
wait 1500
